    "url": "https://www.aicte.gov.in/sites/default/files/ug-vol1.pdf",
    "note": "Mechanics, oscillations and waves, optics, lasers and quantum physics follow the AICTE Physics options. Fibre optics, relativity and solid state follow the AICTE-model first-year syllabi of IET Lucknow (Engineering Physics) and GCE Kalahandi (Physics); thermodynamics follows GCE Kalahandi's first-year Basics of Mechanical Engineering, Module I. Electricity and magnetism is the Electricity & Magnetism subject, linked here (not copied)."
